{"batchcomplete":true,"query":{"pages":[{"pageid":65342312,"ns":0,"title":"Bifacial solar cells","extract":"A bifacial solar cell (BSC) is a photovoltaic solar cell that can produce electrical energy from both front and rear side. In contrast, monofacial solar cells produce electrical energy only when photons are incident on their front side.","description":"Solar cell that can produce electrical energy from each side of the cell","descriptionsource":"local"}]}}